    <data key="d0">Replicon's Multi-Tenant Architecture with Customer-Managed Keys</data>
    <data key="d1">https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=EXAMPLE_VIDEO_LINK</data>
    <data key="d2">This architecture demonstrates Replicon's SaaS-based time tracking and project management solution, showcasing a multi-tenant system with an option for enterprise customers to bring their own AWS KMS CMK for dedicated data encryption in Aurora. The Inter-Infrastructure Intelligence (I3) system, built on Fargate and DynamoDB, handles routing requests to the appropriate data store based on customer type.</data>
    <data key="d3">SaaS, Security, Data Management, Multi-tenancy</data>
    <data key="d4">True</data>
